WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A roofer in a brimmed hat, long sleeves, high-visibility straps and a tool belt leans toward a pitched roof, reaching toward the shingles.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
The worker shifts the torso and continues moving both arms near the roof surface; a hand tool and roofing material are visible below.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The worker stays bent over the roof and continues working. Trees remain in the background. This silent stock clip illustrates the work context, not the research experiments.
